{"reviewId": "921486663_8beD08wai", "review": {"abstract": "所以2008年是第一次机会。第二次机会在2019年，最后一次在2030年左右，如果抓住一次，你就能够成为中产阶层，这就是人生发财靠康波的道理。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 23, "content": "1819年我都错过了，我也不知道2030年。我能有怎样的一个把握？反正我现在心情是比较平静的，我希望自己是一个踏踏实实的既把握住自己符合自己价值观灵性内心目标，以及自己能力的一个方向，然后又契合整个趋势吧。反正先码住，如果2030年我的目标，我的理想，我的生活都一步步转好，我就过来看一看我当年的文字，我不要求2030年我能把握住什么机会，因为我知道很多东西就是一点一滴踏实积累，以其富贵在天。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4198-4269", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "921486663_8beD08wai", "userVid": 921486663, "topics": [], "createTime": 1786289540, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 921486663, "name": "养猪生产大队", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELlKKV0RvTkVpnhf1KicGIcGXtL2r4Ip1ngxpLuhLsdw9jJ3wG3qdktja4UBZdwnntPMeBBIQ6DNHtnBuuSW9QUTrbbwp68Hg5GRodatCzTOvQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 39335366, "name": "纯心做人", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0028-FdMGJhMaVQ31iojuimEEde9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "纯心做人", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-500", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 500}}], "commentsCount": 1, "h